The docs folder contains comprehensive documentation for all major components of the Shattered Archive project, including client architecture, server protocols, deployment strategies, and technical definitions. It serves as a central knowledge base that helps developers understand how different modules like the MUD client, WebSocket proxy server, and web interfaces integrate with each other. The documentation covers everything from local development environments and Docker setups to game protocol details and API endpoints, making it essential for both new contributors and existing team members working across the project's various technical layers.
